<title>MEXICO: Berol Corp ups stake in Mexican subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Berol Corp ups stake in Mexican subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berol Corp will up its stake in pen makers Berol S.A. de C.V. to almost 100 percent, the company reported to the Mexican Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>U.S.-based Berol Corp is to buy 2,226,427 of 1 series shares in Berol S.A. de C.V , thereby raising its stake in the latter's share capital from 81.35 percent to 99.83 percent.</p>
<p>--Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9562</p>
</text>
